{"id":110,"name":"النصر","transliteration":"An-Nasr","translation_fr":"Le secours","translation_en":"The Divine Support","type":"medinan","total_verses":3,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"إِذَا جَآءَ نَصۡرُ ٱللَّهِ وَٱلۡفَتۡحُ","translation_fr":"Lorsque vient le secours d'Allah ainsi que la victoire","translation_en":"When the victory of Allah has come and the conquest","transliteration":"Itha jaa nasru Allahi waalfathu"},{"id":2,"text":"وَرَأَيۡتَ ٱلنَّاسَ يَدۡخُلُونَ فِي دِينِ ٱللَّهِ أَفۡوَاجٗا","translation_fr":"et que tu vois les gens entrer en foule dans la religion d'Allah","translation_en":"And you see the people entering into the religion of Allah in multitudes","transliteration":"Waraayta alnnasa yadkhuloona fee deeni Allahi afwajan"},{"id":3,"text":"فَسَبِّحۡ بِحَمۡدِ رَبِّكَ وَٱسۡتَغۡفِرۡهُۚ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ تَوَّابَۢا","translation_fr":"alors, par la louange, célèbre la gloire de ton Seigneur et implore Son pardon. Car c'est Lui le grand Accueillant au repentir","translation_en":"Then exalt [Him] with praise of your Lord and ask forgiveness of Him. Indeed, He is ever Accepting of repentance","transliteration":"Fasabbih bihamdi rabbika waistaghfirhu innahu kana tawwaban"}]}